```Rule: Invalid user probing (account enumeration) | MITRE T1087.001 | Python rule: invalid_user_probing```
```Logic: >= 5 attempts with usernames that do not exist, from one IP, inside 10 minutes```
index=linux sourcetype=linux_secure "Invalid user"
| rex "Invalid user (?<user>\S+) from (?<src_ip>\d{1,3}(\.\d{1,3}){3})"
| sort 0 _time
| streamstats time_window=10m count AS attempts_10m BY src_ip
| where attempts_10m >= 5
| stats max(attempts_10m) AS attempts values(user) AS usernames_tried BY src_ip host
